{"title":"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Twelve million added to twelve thousand equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/4103c72e508b15954ccf109891d5141be620af70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 12,012,000 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 12,120,000 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 120,120,000 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 12,000,012,000 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 12,012,000,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"808\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Twelve million is written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/c/7fcb31f8f30c0a390f94bd4dce695064e66524c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12,000,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" /> and twelve thousand is written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/0990e8739c74941fdd2a4d649925e71d52b1bc12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />, so the sum of these two numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90e9ebaaaf4c81d06979d89e7975b396727359f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12,012,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005